        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Teinosuke Kinugasa, Don O. Newland\n- Roles: actor, film director, producer\n- Works: Dedication of the Great Buddha\n- Topics: Japanese film, American film\n\nFacts:\n- Teinosuke Kinugasa was born on 1 January 1896 and became a Japanese actor and film director.\n- Don Oliver Newland was born in 1896 and became an American film director and producer.\n- Dedication of the Great Buddha is a 1952 Japanese film directed by Teinosuke Kinugasa.\n- Don O. Newland died in 1951, and his career consisted largely of itinerant work.\n- Teinosuke Kinugasa died on 26 February 1982.",
